docs {
  Endpoint: GET {{baseUrl}}/api/counties
  List counties with `cities_count`.

  Query param: `name` string, optional. County-name substring filter.

  Response 200: `{ "counties": [...] }`.
  Errors: 422 invalid query values.
}
